'''Lizardman shamans''' are monsters found in the [[Chambers of Xeric]], in the lizardmen shaman room. They do not count for [[Sherlock|Sherlock's]] [[master clue]] step that requires players to kill a lizardman shaman.

Like their [[Lizardman shaman|surface]] counterparts, the shamans inside the Chambers of Xeric share the same attack set. Regardless of team size, their poison blob attack is ~25% stronger, dealing up to 39 damage to players caught in it without the appropriate [[Shayzien armour]] protection.

The amount of players in the team determines the number of lizardmen shamans encountered in the room. A maximum of five shamans can be encountered in large teams, with a minimum of two for solo and very small teams.

Shamans regenerate their stats at a rate of 1 per 20 ticks, faster than the standard rate of 1 per 100 ticks.{{CiteDiscord|author=Mod Ash|url=https://discord.com/channels/324132423636090880/434286997360738305/1524701424460628080|date=9 July 2026|quote=Stone guardians - 8 Muttadiles - 15 Vasa Nistirio - 10 Vasa's crystal - 9 Tekton - 15 LizardShamans - 20 Skeletal mystics - 25 Jewelled Crabs - 1 Vespula - 10 Vespula's portal - 45 Vespula's grubs - 10000 (i.e. never) Vespine soldier (flying) - 16 Vespine soldier (walking) - 10000 Otherwise default should be 100, as for outside CoX.|ctxquote=Hi@JagexAsh would you per chance be able to say the regen time (in ticks) for mobs in chambers?}}

